## Create New Project
Run the **`init`** command to create a new Next.js project or to setup an existing one:

<CLI command='init' />

### Registry
First, add the HQ UI in your **`components.json`**:

```json title="components.json"
  ...
  "registries": {
    "@hq": "https://hq-ui.vercel.app/r/{name}"
  }
```
### Add Components
